# A list element the list need not have.
-- source.cue --
l: [...int]
-- target.cue --
f: int
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {f: input.l[0]}
-- out --
not total
result.f copies input.l[0], which may be absent: input.l[0] is an element the list need not have (its length is uint); guard the field with if input.l[0] != _|_ (rule source-absent) @ lens.cue:2:13
